; Run on the segments last first. Each segment's five cards from sum in (send, and after the segment that ends a
; sentence its summary: L, the tail's start, M and the end); its sentence's summary out, four cards, taken from the
; segment that ends the sentence, which comes first when they run last first.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   send     03-19: a segment: a new summary, or the one before
  04                    INP   a
  05                    INP   b
  06                    INP   c
  07                    INP   d
  08                    CLA   send
  09                    SUB   00
  10                    TAC   out
  11                    CLA   a
  12                    STO   l
  13                    CLA   b
  14                    STO   t
  15                    CLA   c
  16                    STO   m
  17                    CLA   d
  18                    STO   e
  19            out     OUT   l
  20                    OUT   t
  21                    OUT   m
  22                    OUT   e
  23                    JMP   rec
  30            send    DATA  0
  31            a       DATA  0
  32            b       DATA  0
  33            c       DATA  0
  34            d       DATA  0
  35            l       DATA  0
  36            t       DATA  0
  37            m       DATA  0
  38            e       DATA  0
